        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Update "formFactor" to "formFactors" in NavigatorUAData.getHighEntropyValues]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40388</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40388"/>
        <updated>2025-07-17T12:38:11.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25359948?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Replaced all occurrences of "formFactor" with "formFactors" in the NavigatorUAData.getHighEntropyValues documentation and examples to ensure consistency with the latest API specification.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">The API and related browser implementations now use "formFactors" (plural) instead of "formFactor" (singular). Updating the documentation helps prevent confusion and ensures that readers follow the current specification.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

