<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes pull request #40248.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3211212555" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40248" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/40248/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40248">#40248</a>    <a href="https://codepen.io/dweinz/pen/GdMbPz" rel="nofollow"></a></p>]]></content>
